Add morphism operations to algebra::signature

For every model `M`, register the dom and cod projections (each typed
`Mor<M> -> M`) as Funcs alongside the model and mor type ids on
`ModelIds` (renamed from `ModelTypeIds`, since it now carries func ids
too). For every member type `T` of a model `M`, register a `mor_app`
Func typed `(Mor<M>, T) -> T` in a new
`Signature::mor_app_func_for_type` lookup.

These funcs are created in pass 1 of `build_signature` next to the
types they project from, before the user-declared funcs registered in
pass 2.
